    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewAspect": "join",
      "reviewBody": "The authors linked each participant’s longitudinal demographic and health data from the FFCWS with the caregiver‑reported food‑security status collected via the USDA module to create a single analytic file containing early‑childhood food‑insecurity exposure.",
